    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaka àhamila ku Gelali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi nkukamola indala inji nchilambo achila, tofauti na indala aila inahumidile mmahiku langa Iblahimu. Bahi Isaka nkuhwena ku Gelali kwanga Abimeleki nfalume wa Vafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahwe nkunhumila Isaka nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Unahwene ku Misili, ila wako hwena ukaikale nchilambo chinimbekuhaulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikala nchilambo anecho malinga mmidi, nanangu nguchinguve pamo na wako na kukubaliki. Nangu nguchingutimise ahadi inimwahidite atatako Iblahimu, kwa kuva vilambo avino vyammalele nìmbekwing'a wako chalumo na vanu va nnukolo lwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vanu va nnukolo lwako nìmbevatenda kuva vohe namene malinga dinondwa dya kumahunde, na nìmbeveng'a vilambo avino vyammalele. Kupitila vanu va nnukolo lwako, nìmbevabaliki vanu va vilambo vyammalele vya pachilambo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa kuva Iblahimu áningupilikana nangu na kulakamuliha malaijo langu na amuli dyangu na mashaliti langu na Sheliya dyangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isaka nkuikala aneko ku Gelali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Valume va aneko pavammujije kwamba n'jawe, nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ayuno nnumbwangu.” Áhawile uchocho kwa kuva, áyopile venedi va chilambo anecho vanammwalala ing'anya ya Labeka, kwa kuva Labeka ávele nkongwe akatapêle namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isaka bada ya kuikala aneko maduva lohe, Abimeleki, nfalume wa Vafilisti, nkupenekela palidilisha lyake kulola pahi, nkumwona Isaka ankumbatidìlè Labeka, n'jawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki nkunchema Isaka nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Muhiu ayu n'jalo! Ing'anya ntwani úhawile kuva nnumbulo?” Isaka nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ngúyopa nawalalwa ing'anya yanga nang'e.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Chinu ntwani achino chiututendeledile? Kwikave munu yumo muvanu vangu walàlà na n'jalo, wako ukanitutenda tùùve na likosa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Abimeleki nkuhumya amuli kwa vanu vake vammalele kuva, “Munu woheyo ambentênda chinu chohecho chibaya munu ayu au n'jawe, achiawalalwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka anewo Isaka nkupanda dimbeyu nchilambo anecho, nkuvuna mafuno lohe namene, kwa kuva Yahwe ánim'baliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nkutajilika, nkuhalija kupata dimali mpaka nkuva tajili nkulungwa namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka ávele na matunji la dingandolo na ding'ombe dyohe na vatumwa vohe, mpaka Vafilisti kumwonela wiu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Vafilisti nkuvihuhulila vihima vyammalele vya medi, vivanahimbile vatumwa vanga Iblahimu atatake, panavele mumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Abimeleki nkunnyaulila Isaka kuchidoni, “Uka apano, kwa kuva wako ùvele na dimongo kutupunda hwetu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isaka nkuuka aneko, nkunaikala nnuhunde lwa Gelali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nkuvihukula kavila avila vihima vya medi vivanahuhulidile Vafilisti bada ya kuhwa kwanga Iblahimu. Isaka nkuvichema malina ulala lanachemile atatake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga vatumishi vanga Isaka pavachihimba vihima amula nnuhunde, nkudawola medi lachikulula pahi kwa pahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "henga vachunga va apala pa Gelali nkupwatana na vachunga vanga Isaka uvachidoni, “Alano medi letu.” Bahi Isaka nkuchichema achila chihima, “Eseki”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eseki mana lake “kupwatana.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa kuva vánipwatana nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vatumishi vanga Isaka nkuhimba chihima chinji, nachinang'o uchocho nkuchipwatanila, Isaka nkuchichema chihima anecho Sitina, mana lake “umongo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isaka nkuhwena pachinu panji nkunahimba chihima chinji. Henga anecho nanga pavanapwatanidile. Isaka nkuchichema chihima anecho, “Lehobosi,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lehobosi mana lake “nafasi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa kuva áhawile kuchidoni, “Yahwe ànitwing'a nafasi, na hwetu tuchitujaliwe nchilambo achino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nkuuka anepo nkuhwena ku Beli-Sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chilo uchila Yahwe nkunhumila nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nni Nnungu wa atatako Iblahimu. Unayope, kwa kuva ngùvele pamo na wako. Nìmbekubaliki na kuvatenda kuva vohe namene vanu va nnukolo lwako kwajili ya Iblahimu, ntumishi wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi aneko, Isaka nkun'dengela Yahwe chitala cha kunhumija sadaka, nkunnyuwa kwa lina lyake. Nkudenga n'gongwe wake, na vatumishi vake nkuhimba chihima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kupatana kwa Isaka na Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmahiku anelo, Abimeleki nkuuka ku Gelali nkummwenela Isaka akuno alongènè na Ahuzati nshauli wake na Fikoli, nkulu wa matiyala lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Mwadachi mùidile kwang'une wakati mwenu mùnanguvenga na múninguvinganga kwenu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Muhiu hwetu tùwene kuva Yahwe àvele pamo na wako. Bahi hwetu nkwona kuva inafala twapilanile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuva, ukambetutendela mabaya malinga hwetu chitukakutendeledile mabaya. Hwetu túkutendeledile lambone na kukuleka uhwene kwa amani bila kukutendela ubaya wohewo. Na wako vino nni munu ubalikiwîje na Yahwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isaka nkuvatendela ing'ole, vanang'o nkulya na kukumbila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liduva lipapête vammalele nkutakatukanga ulyamba namambumbu nkwapilanila. Bahi Isaka nkuvapelekela, nkulekana kwa amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liduva ulila vatumishi vanga Isaka nkummwenela Isaka nkunnyaulila habali dya achila chihima chivanahimbile, kuchidoni, “Tùnidowola medi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nkuchichema chihima anecho “Sheba,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sheba mana lake “chiapilo” au “saba.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bahi imanga ivêle anepo mpaka nelo ìchemwa Beli-Sheba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beli-Sheba mana lake “chihima cha chiapilo” au “chihima cha saba” Lola Ntandiliko 21:31.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vajavake Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
